The NucleoOS Arduboy shim and build tools in this folder (shim/, host/, *.py, *.sh) are licensed
under the BSD 3-clause license below, so that the apps they produce can carry the licenses of the
games (MIT, BSD, Apache-2.0, Unlicense) and of the Arduboy2 library they are built with.

The Arduboy2 and Arduboy libraries (Scott Allen / Arduboy LLC, BSD 3-clause), ArduboyTonesPitches.h
(Scott Allen, MIT), FixedPointsArduino (Pharap, Apache-2.0) and Arduboy-TinyFont (Botond Kis,
BSD 3-clause) are fetched at pinned commits by fetch.sh and keep their own licenses; patch_libs.py
records the changes made to them. host/font5x7.h is a copy of the NucleoOS system font.

